If on Ops Agent, you see a yellow warning with the following:  
"The Ops Agent can be installed but may be lacking permissions to send telemetry. Please choose a different Service Account or add the necessary IAM roles."  

What you're going to do is go to
IAM & Admin -> Service Accounts -> Create service account
Name: windows-ops-agent
ID: windows-ops-agent

Grant the following permission:
- Logs Writer
- Logs Bucker
- Monitoring Metric Writer

Back to creating the vm, choose Service Account, choose that one you just created:
Back to Ops agent, a yellow warning no longer should be there. 
